// Lipizzan Sedan body: a mid-2000s big Italian-school grand touring four-door.
//
// Intent: long, low and proud. A long hood with a big oval grille between swept lamps, a
// steep windshield set well back, a roof that arcs over a long four-door cabin into a
// short deck with swept tail lamps, bright trim round the glass, a low line along the
// flanks and big multi-spoke wheels filling the arches. Generic period cues only.
//
// Units are meters; x runs rearward from the nose, y up from the ground. Layout:
// docs/VEHICLES.md and crates/vehicle/src/shape/params.rs.
